    {
      "text": "It's very important that we understand how important it is that we come and join together on Friday. There is nothing that should keep us from that. What I wrote in the margin, and I don't know when it was I wrote it, but I wrote in the margin of those three verses, illusion and unreal, and we need to leave it as easily as we turn off the television, because this is what's real. Coming together at Jumu'ah and to study Quran and be with believers is real. The rest of the world we live in is the illusion that God created to sustain us and guide us and teach us and extend His mercy to us. But it's set up entirely for us. It's like some giant playground. Some people get injured on the playground, and some people have a wonderful time. But it is an illusion, and this is the real thing. There's nothing that should keep us from this. Absolutely nothing.",
